{
  "gaps": [
    {
      "id": "cross-route-delegation",
      "description": "把同一份任务委派给与父级当前模型不同的路由（其他厂商或同厂商其他模型）运行：跨厂商第二意见、多模型评审面板、模型竞速，以及事先枚举可委派的可用路由。",
      "sources": [
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md#subagents",
        "pstack/skills/arena/SKILL.md#phase-a-phase-c",
        "pstack/skills/swarm/SKILL.md#phase-a",
        "pstack/skills/setup-pstack/SKILL.md#steps",
        "dsh.md#models",
        "dsh-evidence.md#models"
      ],
      "evidence": "上游把跨厂商委派定为工作流硬条件：arena 的 judge never from the parent's vendor，评审面板一个 runner 一个厂商，第二意见是 same prompt on another vendor's model，swarm 模型竞速要求 name each arm's model up front，setup-pstack 要求先枚举可传入的模型路由。DSH 运行时证据（已安装 0.2.2-rc.2 公开文档与配置）：dsh-web-app/presets/cordis.patch.yml 的 tool-subagent 启用 modelSelection+modelDiscovery，但 @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent README 写明 Without a recorded Session policy, discovery and explicit selection permit only the parent Agent's current effective provider/model and its supported efforts；dsh-base 两个开关均默认关闭。即标准模式不保证父级路由之外的委派可选，AGENTS.md 链只能传文字，改不了路由授权层。",
      "status": "proposed"
    },
    {
      "id": "readonly-child-delegation",
      "description": "在会话本身可写的情况下，委派一个文件写入被强制只读的子代理（评审、只读调研），只靠提示词约束不算保证。",
      "sources": [
        "pstack/skills/how/SKILL.md",
        "pstack/skills/arena/SKILL.md#phase-c",
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md#subagents",
        "dsh.md#subagent-fields",
        "dsh-evidence.md#subagent-字段"
      ],
      "evidence": "上游直接要求只读子代理：how 规定 Spawn one Task subagent with readonly: true，arena 的 judge 是 readonly judge，poteto-mode 的委派默认含 readonly 选项。DSH 运行时证据：@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent 的参数与配置（provider/toolName/modelSelection/modelDiscovery/agentOptions/allowedAgentPresets）没有 sandbox 或 readonly 字段，dsh-web-app/presets/cordis.patch.yml 的 tool-subagent 也未配置；写入限制只存在于会话级 sandbox-policy/permission-presets，子代理继承会话权限模式，无法单独收紧为只读。playground/native/dsh.md 的 native 答案也只给出提示词约束加事后 git status 检查，不构成保证。",
      "status": "proposed"
    },
    {
      "id": "companion-skill-gates",
      "description": "commit 前的 /deslop 文风清理关卡，以及交付 UI/IDE/CLI 时的 control-ui/control-cli 验证技能：上游工作流把这些技能当作不可跳过的关卡，标准模式不提供等价技能。",
      "sources": [
        "pstack/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md#non-negotiables",
        "dsh.md#cursor-only-features"
      ],
      "evidence": "上游 poteto-mode 的 Non-negotiables 写明 Before commit → /deslop from the cursor-team-kit plugin 与 Shipping UI / IDE / CLI → control-ui or control-cli from cursor-team-kit；这不是可选步骤而是关卡。DSH 运行时证据（已安装 0.2.2-rc.2）：标准 Web 组合的内建技能目录只有 dsh-doc（dsh-agent-preset/skills/），不含 deslop、control-ui、control-cli 等价物；规则允许收录可选插件依赖的内部契约，当上游工作流明确依赖且标准模式缺失时。该条目是否由当前 treatment 负责闭合需用户确认。",
      "status": "proposed"
    }
  ],
